        "collapsible_tab_w9GJPg": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How subscriptions work",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "content": "<p><strong>Never miss out on the freshest food in town! Let us take care of the shopping for you by creating a subscription. </strong></p><p>Step 1: Choose one of our <a href=\"https://joywholefoods.com.au/collections/subscription-boxes\" title=\"Seasonal-set-boxes-fruit-veg-brisbane-gold-coast-delivery-organic\">Seasonal Set Boxes</a>. As an added bonus - you'll save $5 on every box!</p><p>Step 2: Add your staples like bread, milk, cheese and eggs. We have a selection of these items that are always available.</p><p>Step 3: Each week you'll get an email from us confirming your order. Login to the subscription portal to edit your order and add one-time items like meat, pantry items, extra veg and so much more.</p><p>It's super easy to set up and you can pause or cancel anytime, as long as it's by midnight Tuesday the week you want to make changes.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
